=== Conditional Explanation Reliability ===
Subset: instances the model classifies CORRECTLY on BOTH the clean and
the perturbed input. This isolates explanation-level failure from
prediction-level failure.

stability  = token-Jaccard(clean rationale, perturbed rationale); higher=more stable
labelcons  = fraction of rationales that ENTAIL the model's own predicted label (NLI proxy)
Grounding/unsupported-cue is NOT reported: automatic verification proved
unreliable (see paper limitations).

